@node Overview
@chapter Overview

@samp{goldendict-ng.el} provides an Emacs interface to @uref{https://xiaoyifang.github.io/goldendict-ng/, GoldenDict-NG}, a powerful open-source dictionary lookup program. The package invokes GoldenDict-NG's @uref{https://xiaoyifang.github.io/goldendict-ng/topic_commandline/, command-line interface} to trigger searches from within Emacs. The dictionary results themselves are displayed in GoldenDict-NG's own window, not inside Emacs.

The package centers on a single interactive command, @code{goldendict-ng-search}, which determines a search string from context (the active region, the word at point, or a minibuffer prompt) and launches GoldenDict-NG with the appropriate arguments. You can control which dictionary group is queried, whether results appear in the main window or a scanpopup, and various other GoldenDict-NG flags.

A notable feature is automatic language detection: when you configure dictionary groups with their associated languages, the package can use GNU Aspell to identify the language of the search string and narrow the group selection accordingly. This is especially useful for multilingual users who maintain separate dictionary groups for different languages.

