@end menu

@node Requirements
@section Requirements

@itemize
@item
Emacs 25.1 or later.
@item
@uref{https://xiaoyifang.github.io/goldendict-ng/install/, GoldenDict-NG} must be installed and accessible on your system.
@item
@uref{http://aspell.net/, GNU Aspell} is required only if you enable automatic language detection via @code{goldendict-ng-narrow-groups-to-matching-languages} (@ref{Language detection}). You will also need the relevant Aspell language dictionaries installed.
@end itemize

